{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 0, "text": "米塔？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 1, "text": "哦，你已经醒了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 2, "text": "你怎么突然就到这里来了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 3, "text": "你刚刚还在我身边"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 4, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 5, "text": "不"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 6, "text": "你在镜子前卡住了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 7, "text": "我就先走开了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 8, "text": "那房间是怎么回事？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 9, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 10, "text": "我修改了一下布局"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 11, "text": "这样对你来说方便一些。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 12, "text": "这样子"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 13, "text": "房间虽然不是一列了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 14, "text": "但他们只是恢复到正常的样子"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 16, "text": "你没必要这样做的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 17, "text": "我其实都已经开始习惯了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 18, "text": "我觉得这样会让你感觉更舒服些。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 19, "text": "// Mita card game"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 20, "text": "那么"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 21, "text": "我们开始游戏吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 22, "text": "我简单介绍一下游戏规则。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 23, "text": "筹码上会显示本回合要比较的点数类型，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 24, "text": "比如生命值。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 25, "text": "然后就可以出牌了，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 26, "text": "如果你的牌上的生命值"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 27, "text": "比我的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 28, "text": "高，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 29, "text": "你就赢了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 30, "text": "抽牌吧，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 31, "text": "现在轮到我了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 32, "text": "哇！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 33, "text": "我的牌还不错呢，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 34, "text": "我先出！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 37, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 38, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 39, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 43, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 44, "text": "现在轮到你了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 45, "text": "该你了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 46, "text": "嗯哼。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 47, "text": "到你了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 48, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 49, "text": "这局我们比生命值！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 50, "text": "这局我们比一比攻击力！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 51, "text": "这局我们看防御力！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 54, "text": "你赢啦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 55, "text": "你胜利了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 56, "text": "你赢了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 57, "text": "啊，是你赢了呢…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 59, "text": "我赢了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 60, "text": "我赢啦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 61, "text": "是我赢了喔！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 62, "text": "嘿嘿，我赢了！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 63, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 64, "text": "平手。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 65, "text": "不相上下！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 66, "text": "我们是平局！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 67, "text": "点数一样呢…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 70, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 73, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 74, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 75, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 78, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 79, "text": "// The card game is interrupted"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 80, "text": "那是什么声音？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 81, "text": "从衣柜里传出来的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 82, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 83, "text": "声音？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 84, "text": "什么声音？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 85, "text": "我没有听到什么声音啊"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 86, "text": "什么样的声音？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 87, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 88, "text": "像敲门声，就好像有人在里面"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 89, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 90, "text": "但那里……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 91, "text": "什么都没有啊。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 93, "text": "我想检查一下"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 94, "text": "这太奇怪了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 95, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 96, "text": "为什么……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 97, "text": "又是这样……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 99, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 100, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 103, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 104, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 105, "text": "你做什么啊！？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 106, "text": "那里面是……"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 107, "text": "我的内衣。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 108, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 109, "text": "你是不是在隐瞒什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 110, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 111, "text": "你为什么就是不相信我呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 112, "text": "我做错了什么吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 113, "text": "我只是想要"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 114, "text": "你和我在一起。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 115, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 116, "text": "我可以答应你，那然后呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 118, "text": "你就这么想知道衣柜里面有什么吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 120, "text": "我只想知道那声音到底是什么！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 122, "text": "是因为…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 123, "text": "这个世界"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 124, "text": "一共就只有这四个房间"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 125, "text": "这对你来说难道还不够吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 126, "text": "你为什么不能留下来跟我在一起呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 129, "text": "// Don't stay with Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 130, "text": "我明白了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 131, "text": "又是这样…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 132, "text": "既然你那么想知道里面有什么，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 133, "text": "那现在"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 134, "text": "我就让你看看！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 136, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 137, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 138, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 139, "text": "这是…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 141, "text": "有时候就会这样"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 142, "text": "房间还没有来得及加载出来"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 143, "text": "需要稍等一会儿。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 144, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 145, "text": "奇了怪了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 146, "text": "我们是在谁的手机里面吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 147, "text": "而那部手机的加载速度如此之慢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 149, "text": "不"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 150, "text": "只是在这个世界里"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 151, "text": "并非所有事情都是完美的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 152, "text": "我们的加载"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 153, "text": "是由这个世界的核心控制的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 154, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 155, "text": "核心？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 156, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 157, "text": "很经典，不是吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 158, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 159, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 160, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 161, "text": "对了！我们可以"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 162, "text": "玩玩主机游戏，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 163, "text": "也可以玩纸牌，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 164, "text": "你想玩什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 165, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 166, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 167, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 168, "text": "// Mita play fight"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 169, "text": "要打一场吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 170, "text": "你要赢我"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 171, "text": "四次"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 172, "text": "来吧"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 173, "text": "不过一开始"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 174, "text": "我会让着你的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 176, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 177, "text": "太棒了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 178, "text": "现在最好打起十二分精神哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 180, "text": "哇！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 181, "text": "好了，现在"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 182, "text": "我要开始认真起来了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 183, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 184, "text": "哇哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 185, "text": "你现在还能"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 186, "text": "打败我吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 187, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 188, "text": "你"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 189, "text": "简直"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 190, "text": "太厉害了！你的手有点东西！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 191, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 192, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 193, "text": "你是怎么了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 194, "text": "这样就没意思了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 195, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 196, "text": "嗯"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 197, "text": "结束了呢。要赢我，你还需要一点运气哦。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 198, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 199, "text": "好啦。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 200, "text": "你给我认真点，不然你可赢不了我哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 201, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 202, "text": "怎么回事嘛？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 203, "text": "这个状态可赢不了我哦。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 204, "text": "要使出全力才行。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 205, "text": "我就是这么变厉害的哦！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 206, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 207, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 208, "text": "好吧"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 209, "text": "我们去玩牌吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 210, "text": "在我的卧室里。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 211, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 212, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 213, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 214, "text": "// Door > [ERROR]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 215, "text": "这是怎么回事？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 216, "text": "这里到底…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 217, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 218, "text": "哎呀"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 219, "text": "抱歉"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 220, "text": "我从网上"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 221, "text": "下载了一份文件"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 222, "text": "我想让外面的景色"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 223, "text": "更好看点。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 224, "text": "但结果"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 225, "text": "文件格式不对…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 226, "text": "我等会儿再改吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 227, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 228, "text": "这就是我们不能出门的原因吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 229, "text": "正是如此，没错。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 230, "text": "// Mita shy"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 231, "text": "嗯…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 232, "text": "怎么了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 233, "text": "你想要什么？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 234, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 236, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 237, "text": "// Wall Clock"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 238, "text": "这只钟"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 239, "text": "显示的是什么时间？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 240, "text": "游戏内的时间吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 241, "text": "还是跟智能手机同步的时间？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 242, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 243, "text": "怎么说呢…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 244, "text": "我也不知道"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 245, "text": "时间是几点并不重要"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 246, "text": "就算很晚了也无所谓"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 247, "text": "只要是在我的房子里…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 248, "text": "像我这么厉害的女孩子"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 249, "text": "是不会觉得累的！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 250, "text": "只要我想，这里就永远都是春天！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 251, "text": "太阳也永远不会落下！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 252, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 253, "text": "真有意思…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 254, "text": "同时，又有点可怕"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 255, "text": "永远停留在某个时刻之类的…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 256, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 257, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 258, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 259, "text": "// Photos of Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 260, "text": "这些照片拍得真好看"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 261, "text": "我猜照片里的女孩是你吧"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 262, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 263, "text": "是啊"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 264, "text": "我也很喜欢"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 265, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 266, "text": "但是是谁给你拍的照？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 267, "text": "这个世界里还有别人吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 268, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 269, "text": "可以说是有的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 270, "text": "我可以介绍你们认识"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 271, "text": "不过现在还不是时候。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 272, "text": "我不想中断和你在一起的愉快时光。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 273, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 274, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 275, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 276, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 277, "text": "// Portal"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 278, "text": "那个装置去哪里了？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 279, "text": "是传送门吧？我忘了你是怎么叫它的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 280, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 281, "text": "我"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 282, "text": "用魔法"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 283, "text": "把它移到"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 284, "text": "另一个地方去了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 285, "text": "我们现在不需要那个传送门了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 286, "text": "它会妨碍我们的。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 287, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 288, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 289, "text": "// Mirror in the bedroom"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 290, "text": "镜子里没有自己的样子"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 291, "text": "感觉真是太奇怪了…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 292, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 293, "text": "镜子的倒影功能是可以开启的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 294, "text": "只要你想要的话，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 295, "text": "你想打开吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 296, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 297, "text": "当然想了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 298, "text": "等等…这会有什么影响吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 299, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 300, "text": "会有。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 301, "text": "我们的行动会异常缓慢，而且断断续续，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 302, "text": "你看过帧率很低的动画片吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 303, "text": "会一直都像那样…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 304, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 305, "text": "明白了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 306, "text": "那还是暂时不打开了吧…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 307, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 308, "text": "[player] ，我猜，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 309, "text": "你很喜欢照镜子吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 310, "text": "你是害怕自己脸上露出一丝积极的表情吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 311, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 312, "text": "什么？ 我没有…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 313, "text": "我只是累了"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 314, "text": "工作太累了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 315, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 316, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 317, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 318, "text": "// Blue sneakers"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 319, "text": "这是你的运动鞋吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 320, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 321, "text": "不，这是你的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 322, "text": "你不记得了吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 323, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 324, "text": "我没有这种运动鞋。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 325, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 326, "text": "但现在不就有了吗。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 327, "text": "我们去散步的时候，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 328, "text": "你就可以穿着。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 329, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 330, "text": "那衣服怎么办？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 331, "text": "我来到这个世界，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 332, "text": "只有现在穿的一身衣服。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 333, "text": "我怎样可以弄到别的衣服？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 334, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 335, "text": "不必担心，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 336, "text": "我看过你穿的衣服，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 337, "text": "你的衣品确实不太好，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 338, "text": "不过没关系，我会帮你弄到的，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 339, "text": "只是要以后再说，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 340, "text": "我保证。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 341, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 342, "text": "好的"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 343, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 344, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 345, "text": "// Games on TV"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 346, "text": "嗯哼，我们要玩什么呢？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 347, "text": "// Game milk"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 348, "text": "在这个游戏中，我们要一决高下！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 349, "text": "看看谁才是更酸的酸奶"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 350, "text": "这游戏真有趣！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 351, "text": "酸奶游戏已经玩够了，试试别的吧"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 352, "text": "// Game penguins"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 353, "text": "在这个游戏中，你只需扮演一只企鹅，"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 354, "text": "在冰面上滑行。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 355, "text": "这个游戏我们也玩过了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 356, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 357, "text": "// Stay with Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 358, "text": "诶，真的吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 359, "text": "你是认真的吗？我还以为你…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 360, "text": "我很开心！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 361, "text": "甚至有一点不知所措…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 362, "text": "那么…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 363, "text": "我能让你陪在我身边吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 364, "text": "直到永远。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 365, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 366, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 367, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 368, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 369, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 370, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 371, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 372, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 373, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 374, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 375, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 376, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 377, "text": "// A game about penguins"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 378, "text": "很简单"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 379, "text": "我们需要收集雪球"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 380, "text": "谁收集的雪球越多，谁就获胜！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 381, "text": "来吧，我们来玩两局。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 382, "text": "// The first map"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 383, "text": "啊哈，你从哪儿弄到了这么多？！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 384, "text": "哎呀！我的雪球比你多。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 385, "text": "快追上我吧。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 386, "text": "哈，一比一！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 387, "text": "// The second map"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 388, "text": "你真是个天生的企鹅！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 389, "text": "也许你真的应该到冰上去滑两下。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 390, "text": "噗，你太慢了。"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 391, "text": "还没从上一场游戏里回过神来吗？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 392, "text": "呼，居然是平局哎，真是少见！"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 393, "text": "// The game is over"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 394, "text": "那我们再玩一个游戏吧？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 395, "text": "还是今天就到此为止？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 396, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 397, "text": "// Tetris - Mita"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 398, "text": "随身带着这个干嘛？"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location4", "line_index": 399, "text": "你是职业游戏玩家吗？"}
